# Critical vulnerabilities accepted for a time (ADR 0027). Each line is a CVE id with a comment: why it does not
# reach us, who decided, and until when. An expired line is a bug: remove it or renew it with a reason.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # <component>: <why it is not reachable>; <who>, until YYYY-MM-DD
